      "sceneId": "scene_4",
      "subheading": null,
      "tableData": null,
      "type": "video_clip",
      "voiceoverScript": "Want to see the bigger picture? Switch to the Cluster Map. This interactive scatter plot maps salaries against AI vulnerability.\n\nLook for the golden quadrant: careers that pay exceptionally well but remain highly resilient to automation.",
